  "body": "This argument is only passed recursively or from importNode(). And importNode() does not work for documents, so whenever the node argument is a document, the document argument has to be the node argument.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n(I want to fix the other aspects of this algorithm too. But I thought I'd make this in isolation while I spotted it.)",
